    "The player, {name}, {building} and {troop} have unknown gender: no verb or adjective agrees with them. Intransitive past/progressive verbs with آپ are avoided (imperatives, ergative نے constructions, آپ سے … , passives or nominal phrases instead); {name} کا/کی/کے agrees with the following noun, so it is safe.",
